  Loaded only when the Test Runner plugin is present.

  It carries no extensions: the dependency itself is the point. The SM test runner
  (SMTRunnerConsoleProperties, OutputToGeneralTestEventsConverter, SMTestLocator, …) left the core
  platform in 2026.2 for the bundled `intellij.testRunner.plugin`, so without this the test
  configuration's classes do not resolve there — 19 NoSuchClassError risks, which is exactly what
  the plugin verifier reported. Optional because 2026.1 still has those classes in the platform and
  has no such plugin to depend on; a hard dependency, in either the v1 or the v2 form, stops the
  plugin loading there at all.
